32.2 Writing lot entries
========================

Lot tracking can be enabled in two ways:

   * _Per posting:_ write explicit cost basis annotations like in Ledger
     or Beancount, or explicit lot subaccount names.  These postings
     will be tracked lotfully.

   * _Per commodity:_ declare the commodity lotful with a 'lots' tag.
     All of its postings are tracked lotfully, and the annotations are
     inferred for you.  This is convenient, and recommended.

   A posting with any of these is called a lot posting.

